Z||000002||falconhulk||12-04-2001||09:44 AM||||He did not lie.  He did not make those comments.  The investors did.  The CEO's of major technology companies like Steve Jobs.  No matter what your opnion Dean Kamen is insanely smart and deserves everyones respect.  He has a gift to envision things that most people lack.  He made himself rich while being was thrown out of college.  read his bio.   its amazing.   Ginger is amazing also.  The price is the only thing holding it back.  Think if it was 100 bucks.  Vcrs were once 1500.  Computers were once 6000.  I never really saw the need for a motorized scooter until I saw the demo in the park they did yesterday.  There were probably 8 NY'ers watching that had electric scooters of thier own!!  They cant ride those in the winter so they walk.  Walking you can slide on ice.  This thing apparently does not.  I think many pieces of this invention will be used in other fields in the future.  Give it a chance.  Its our narrow minded view that prevents us from seeing the possibilities it might create.  After all people saw no need for cars as horses already did the job.||||reg||1
